{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "模块表（唯一出处，ADR-0126）：一张表两个用途——模块分工（owner）与定向门禁的选测依据（toolchain/change_impact.py 读它判级、选测试工程/步骤/引擎侧分类）。",
    "modules 段由 toolchain/gen_module_map.py 从目录结构生成（path/layer/test_namespaces 是派生字段，重新生成会刷新），owner/interaction_exceptions 是人工字段，重新生成时按模块名保留；layers/tier_rules/steps/engine 四段全是人工维护，生成脚本不碰。",
    "门禁自检（check.ps1 的『模块表覆盖所有子模块目录』一步）等价于 python toolchain/gen_module_map.py --check：目录里出现未登记的子模块、或表里登记了不存在的目录，即 FAIL。",
    "子模块 = core/<层>/<模块>/ 与 presentation/<模块>/ 下除 bin、obj、tests、common、assembly 之外的目录；sim 层只有一个子模块（layers.sim.single_module=true，名字即层名，目录 core/sim/）。common/、assembly/ 是层内共享面（记层级范围 T2，见 path_rules），不登记成子模块。",
    "tier_rules 的判级顺序见 toolchain/README.md『定向门禁』一节与 ADR-0126：先看模块公开面（contracts/schema/generated）→ 再看 *.md 与 architecture/docs（T0）→ 再看共享面（T3）→ 再看模块内部（T1）→ 未被任何规则覆盖的路径按 T3。每个路径取最高级的并集。",
    "steps 段登记 check.ps1 每个步骤的触发规则：T3 = 全部触发；T0 只跑 base_tiers 含 T0 的步骤；T1/T2 跑 base_tiers 含该级别的步骤，外加 triggers 命中改动路径的步骤（triggers 默认只看非 .md 路径，trigger_md=true 的步骤例外）；requires 为依赖步骤（被触发的步骤会把依赖一起拉进来）；engine_gated=true 的步骤只在 T3 或引擎侧有待跑分类时才跑。",
    "owner 初版统一 TBD，由设计层分配；跨层改动由上游层负责人拍板。",
    "path_rules（tier_rules 段）：把适配层/层内共享面/资产/模板/钩子等路径类别登记成数据——每条规则 id/globs/except/level，可选 scope=layer（记到所在层：本层测试工程+下游一层+ABI 探针+本层所有模块的引擎侧分类）、dotnet_projects（显式测试工程）、engine_categories/engine_from_file/engine_all（引擎侧 PlayMode 过滤）、steps（额外要跑的步骤）、needs_dll_sync。同一路径命中多条规则取并集、级别取最高；规则命中先于共享面 shared_globs。",
    "steps 段新增字段：needs（dotnet_projects/public_layers：基础步骤只在确有测试工程/确有层级公开面时才选）、needs_unity（引擎侧步骤，判定块单独列出）、dll_sync_gated（引擎侧有待跑分类且改动涉及核心/适配代码时才同步 DLL；纯引擎侧测试改动不同步，前提是 DLL 已与源码同步，见 AGENTS.md §4）。",
    "coverage_roots / coverage_allow_unknown_globs（tier_rules 段）：门禁自检『模块表覆盖所有子模块目录』对新登记的路径类别的延伸——这些根目录下受 git 管理的文件不得落到『未被任何规则覆盖』（默认 T3）；确需保持 T3 的少数文件（Unity 包清单/目录 meta）登记在 coverage_allow_unknown_globs。新增适配层/模板/资产子目录而没登记规则，自检即红。"
  ],
  "layers": {
    "foundation": {
      "path": "core/foundation/",
      "test_project": "core/foundation/tests/Tests.Foundation.csproj",
      "downstream": [
        "numbers"
      ],
      "owner": "TBD"
    },
    "numbers": {
      "path": "core/numbers/",
      "test_project": "core/numbers/tests/Tests.Numbers.csproj",
      "downstream": [
        "rules"
      ],
      "owner": "TBD"
    },
    "rules": {
      "path": "core/rules/",
      "test_project": "core/rules/tests/Tests.Rules.csproj",
      "downstream": [
        "carriers"
      ],
      "owner": "TBD"
    },
    "carriers": {
      "path": "core/carriers/",
      "test_project": "core/carriers/tests/Tests.Carriers.csproj",
      "downstream": [
        "gameplay"
      ],
      "owner": "TBD"
    },
    "gameplay": {
      "path": "core/gameplay/",
      "test_project": "core/gameplay/tests/Tests.Gameplay.csproj",
      "downstream": [
        "sim",
        "presentation"
      ],
      "owner": "TBD"
    },
    "sim": {
      "path": "core/sim/",
      "test_project": "core/sim/tests/Tests.Sim.csproj",
      "downstream": [
        "lab"
      ],
      "single_module": true,
      "owner": "TBD"
    },
    "presentation": {
      "path": "presentation/",
      "test_project": "presentation/tests/Tests.PresentationCommon.csproj",
      "downstream": [
        "lab"
      ],
      "owner": "TBD"
    },
    "lab": {
      "path": "lab/",
      "test_project": "lab/tests/Tests.Lab.csproj",
      "downstream": [],
      "single_module": true,
      "owner": "TBD"
    }
  },
  "tier_rules": {
    "public_dirs": [
      "contracts",
      "schema",
      "generated"
    ],
    "public_file_regex": [
      "^I[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\.cs$",
      "^[A-Za-z0-9_]*Events\\.cs$"
    ],
    "doc_globs": [
      "**/*.md",
      "architecture/**",
      "docs/**",
      "timing/**",
      ".github/**"
    ],
    "shared_tests_globs": [
      "core/*/assembly/tests/**",
      "core/*/common/tests/**",
      "presentation/assembly/tests/**",
      "presentation/common/tests/**"
    ],
    "shared_globs": [
      "**/*.csproj",
      "**/*.sln",
      "Directory.Build.props",
      "check.ps1",
      "build.ps1",
      ".gitattributes",
      "data/**",
      "adapters/stub/**",
      "toolchain/**"
    ],
    "default_level": "T3",
    "path_rules": [
      {
        "id": "layer_shared_surface",
        "label": "层级范围：层内共享面（common/assembly）与层根文件——只被本层与下游通过本层程序集使用，记 T2：本层测试工程 + 下游一层 + ABI 探针 + 本层所有模块的引擎侧分类",
        "globs": [
          "core/*/common/**",
          "core/*/assembly/**",
          "core/*/*",
          "presentation/common/**",
          "presentation/assembly/**",
          "presentation/*"
        ],
        "except": [
          "**/*.csproj",
          "**/*.sln"
        ],
        "level": 2,
        "scope": "layer"
      },
      {
        "id": "stub_tests",
        "label": "桩适配层专项测试：只被 Tests.Foundation 编译（Adapters.Stub.csproj Compile Remove 了该目录）",
        "globs": [
          "adapters/stub/tests/**"
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "dotnet_projects": [
          "core/foundation/tests/Tests.Foundation.csproj"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "shared_perf_calibration",
        "label": "Tests.Sim.csproj 用 Link 直接编译 gameplay 测试目录里的 PerfMachineCalibration.cs：该文件改动要同时跑 Tests.Gameplay 与 Tests.Sim",
        "globs": [
          "core/gameplay/tests/Perf/PerfMachineCalibration.cs"
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "dotnet_projects": [
          "core/gameplay/tests/Tests.Gameplay.csproj",
          "core/sim/tests/Tests.Sim.csproj"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "conformance",
        "label": "一致性套件：被 Tests.Foundation 直接编译，被引擎侧 EditMode/PlayMode 一致性用例引用（asmdef Adapters.Conformance）",
        "globs": [
          "adapters/conformance/**"
        ],
        "level": 2,
        "dotnet_projects": [
          "core/foundation/tests/Tests.Foundation.csproj"
        ],
        "engine_categories": [
          "module:engine_adapter"
        ],
        "steps": [
          "unity_compile",
          "unity_editmode"
        ],
        "needs_dll_sync": true
      },
      {
        "id": "unity_tests_runtime",
        "label": "引擎侧 PlayMode 测试：只跑该文件自己标的分类（文件里没有分类标注则保守跑全部 PlayMode）；不涉及 dotnet",
        "globs": [
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Tests/Runtime/**"
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "engine_from_file": true
      },
      {
        "id": "unity_tests_editor",
        "label": "引擎侧 EditMode 测试：EditMode 用例没有分类，整套 EditMode 跑；不涉及 dotnet",
        "globs": [
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Tests/Editor/**"
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "steps": [
          "unity_editmode"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "unity_runtime_ui_shell",
        "label": "引擎侧运行时 Ui/Shell：Unity 编译 + 分类 ui/shell/shared + 消费方演练",
        "globs": [
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Runtime/Ui/**",
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Runtime/Shell/**"
        ],
        "level": 2,
        "engine_categories": [
          "module:ui",
          "module:shell",
          "module:shared"
        ],
        "steps": [
          "unity_compile",
          "consumer_drill"
        ],
        "needs_dll_sync": true
      },
      {
        "id": "unity_runtime_diagnostics",
        "label": "引擎侧运行时 Diagnostics：Unity 编译 + 分类 shared + 消费方演练",
        "globs": [
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Runtime/Diagnostics/**"
        ],
        "level": 2,
        "engine_categories": [
          "module:shared"
        ],
        "steps": [
          "unity_compile",
          "consumer_drill"
        ],
        "needs_dll_sync": true
      },
      {
        "id": "unity_runtime_wide",
        "label": "引擎侧运行时其余目录（EngineAdapter/Presentation/Bootstrap/包根）：被的用例面太宽，Unity 编译 + 全部 PlayMode + 消费方演练",
        "globs": [
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Runtime/**"
        ],
        "except": [
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Runtime/Ui/**",
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Runtime/Shell/**",
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Runtime/Diagnostics/**"
        ],
        "level": 2,
        "engine_all": true,
        "steps": [
          "unity_compile",
          "consumer_drill"
        ],
        "needs_dll_sync": true
      },
      {
        "id": "unity_diag_forwarding_sources",
        "label": "Unity 包里被 Adapters.Unity.DiagnosticsForwarding.csproj 按引用编译的三个源文件：另跑该转发工程的 dotnet 测试",
        "globs": [
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Runtime/Presentation/PresentationDiagnosticsConsoleForwarding.cs",
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Runtime/Diagnostics/DiagnosticsHub.cs",
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Runtime/Diagnostics/ValidationReportFileOutlet.cs"
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "dotnet_projects": [
          "adapters/unity/DiagnosticsForwarding/tests/Tests.Adapters.Unity.DiagnosticsForwarding.csproj"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "unity_editor",
        "label": "引擎侧编辑器代码：Unity 编译 + EditMode + 分类 shared + 消费方演练",
        "globs": [
          "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Editor/**"
        ],
        "level": 2,
        "engine_categories": [
          "module:shared"
        ],
        "steps": [
          "unity_compile",
          "unity_editmode",
          "consumer_drill"
        ],
        "needs_dll_sync": true
      },
      {
        "id": "diag_forwarding_tests",
        "label": "诊断转发工程及其测试（csproj 本身仍归共享面）",
        "globs": [
          "adapters/unity/DiagnosticsForwarding/**"
        ],
        "except": [
          "**/*.csproj"
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "dotnet_projects": [
          "adapters/unity/DiagnosticsForwarding/tests/Tests.Adapters.Unity.DiagnosticsForwarding.csproj"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "layer_test_projects",
        "label": "层级测试工程文件（core/*/tests、presentation/tests 下的 csproj）：按该测试工程所在层的层级范围记 T2（本层测试工程 + 下游一层 + ABI 探针 + 本层所有模块的引擎侧分类）；生产 csproj、sln、Directory.Build.props 仍归共享面 T3",
        "globs": [
          "core/*/tests/*.csproj",
          "presentation/tests/*.csproj",
          "lab/tests/*.csproj"
        ],
        "level": 2,
        "scope": "layer"
      },
      {
        "id": "diag_forwarding_test_csproj",
        "label": "诊断转发测试工程文件：不在任何核心层里，只改它自己的编译条件，跑它自己的测试工程（T2）；诊断转发生产 csproj 仍归共享面 T3",
        "globs": [
          "adapters/unity/DiagnosticsForwarding/tests/*.csproj"
        ],
        "level": 2,
        "dotnet_projects": [
          "adapters/unity/DiagnosticsForwarding/tests/Tests.Adapters.Unity.DiagnosticsForwarding.csproj"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "toolchain_tests_and_floors",
        "label": "工具链测试与用例数下限：只改 pytest 用例或下限数，只跑 toolchain_pytest（外加秒级自检步骤）；toolchain/ 下其它路径仍归共享面 T3",
        "globs": [
          "toolchain/tests/**",
          "toolchain/gate_floors.json"
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "steps": [
          "toolchain_pytest"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "lab_dataset",
        "label": "手感实验室数据集 data/_lab：只被实验室内核/命令行与 validate_lab_data 读取，不进合并根与任何游戏根；改它只需校验该数据集 + 实验室测试工程 + 指纹基线比对（其余 data/** 仍归共享面 T3）",
        "globs": [
          "data/_lab/**"
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "dotnet_projects": [
          "lab/tests/Tests.Lab.csproj"
        ],
        "steps": [
          "validate_lab_data",
          "feel_lab_suite"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "game_template",
        "label": "游戏模板：模板数据校验 + 模板冒烟（消费方演练）+ .meta 完整性",
        "globs": [
          "games/_template/**"
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "steps": [
          "validate_template_data",
          "consumer_drill"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "assets",
        "label": "资产目录：占位资产生成器一致性 + 样例导入幂等 + 导入检查",
        "globs": [
          "assets/**"
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "steps": [
          "placeholder_assets",
          "sample_import_idem",
          "import_assets_check"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "git_hooks_and_ignore",
        "label": "提交前钩子与忽略规则：门禁自检 + 钩子相关 pytest",
        "globs": [
          ".githooks/**",
          ".gitignore"
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "steps": [
          "hooks_pytest"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "coverage_roots": [
      "adapters/conformance/",
      "adapters/unity/Packages/",
      "adapters/unity/DiagnosticsForwarding/",
      "games/_template/",
      "assets/",
      ".github/",
      ".githooks/"
    ],
    "coverage_allow_unknown_globs": [
      "adapters/unity/Packages/manifest.json",
      "adapters/unity/Packages/packages-lock.json",
      "adapters/unity/Packages/*/package.json",
      "adapters/unity/Packages/*/*.meta",
      "adapters/unity/Packages/*/Tests/*.meta"
    ]
  },
  "engine": {
    "category_prefix": "module:",
    "shared_category": "module:shared",
    "playmode_tests_dir": "adapters/unity/Packages/com.gamefoundation.adapter.unity/Tests/Runtime/",
    "_comment": "引擎侧 PlayMode 测试类按被测模块打 NUnit [Category(\"module:<模块名>\")]，映射不清的打 module:shared；T2 只跑命中模块的分类 + shared（含登记的交互例外分类），T3 跑全部。Unity 的 -testCategory 以分号分隔多个分类，与 -testFilter 取交集，所以交互例外也用分类表达。"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "self_check",
      "label": "门禁自检：Test-NativeExitCode 对失败/成功原生命令正确判定",
      "base_tiers": [
        "T0",
        "T1",
        "T2",
        "T3"
      ],
      "triggers": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ban_codename",
      "label": "禁用词扫描：全仓库不出现具体游戏代号",
      "base_tiers": [
        "T0",
        "T1",
        "T2",
        "T3"
      ],
      "triggers": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ban_arch_terms",
      "label": "禁用词扫描：architecture 正文不出现引擎/语言/框架/工具名",
      "base_tiers": [
        "T0",
        "T1",
        "T2",
        "T3"
      ],
      "triggers": []
    },
    {
      "id": "version_consistency",
      "label": "版本一致性",
      "base_tiers": [
        "T0",
        "T1",
        "T2",
        "T3"
      ],
      "triggers": []
    },
    {
      "id": "branch_name",
      "label": "分支名规范",
      "base_tiers": [
        "T0",
        "T1",
        "T2",
        "T3"
      ],
      "triggers": []
    },
    {
      "id": "module_map_check",
      "label": "模块表覆盖所有子模块目录",
      "base_tiers": [
        "T1",
        "T2",
        "T3"
      ],
      "triggers": []
    },
    {
      "id": "validate_merged",
      "label": "validate_data.py --strict（合并根）",
      "base_tiers": [],
      "triggers": [
        "data/**",
        "core/**/schema/**",
        "presentation/**/schema/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "validate_framework",
      "label": "validate_data.py --data-root data/_framework（框架根）",
      "base_tiers": [],
      "triggers": [
        "data/**",
        "core/**/schema/**",
        "presentation/**/schema/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "schema_audit",
      "label": "元数据门禁 validator --schema-audit",
      "base_tiers": [],
      "triggers": [
        "data/**",
        "core/**/schema/**",
        "presentation/**/schema/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "event_constants",
      "label": "gen_event_constants.py --check",
      "base_tiers": [],
      "triggers": [
        "data/**",
        "core/foundation/event_bus/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "schema_order",
      "label": "format_data.py --schema-order --check",
      "base_tiers": [],
      "triggers": [
        "data/**",
        "core/**/schema/**",
        "presentation/**/schema/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "import_assets_check",
      "label": "import_assets.py check --dataset _sample",
      "base_tiers": [],
      "triggers": [
        "data/**",
        "assets/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "validate_sim_data",
      "label": "validate_data.py --strict --data-root core/sim/tests/data（嵌入仿真数据集）",
      "base_tiers": [],
      "triggers": [
        "data/**",
        "core/sim/tests/data/**",
        "core/**/schema/**",
        "presentation/**/schema/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "validate_template_data",
      "label": "validate_data.py --strict --data-root games/_template/data/game（模板数据根）",
      "base_tiers": [],
      "triggers": [
        "data/**",
        "games/_template/data/**",
        "core/**/schema/**",
        "presentation/**/schema/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "validate_lab_data",
      "label": "validate_data.py --strict --data-root data/_lab（手感实验室数据集，warnings 须为 0）",
      "base_tiers": [],
      "triggers": [
        "data/**",
        "core/**/schema/**",
        "presentation/**/schema/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "crlf_check",
      "label": "工作树文本文件无 CR",
      "base_tiers": [
        "T1",
        "T2",
        "T3"
      ],
      "triggers": [
        ".gitattributes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unity_meta",
      "label": "Unity .meta 完整性检查",
      "base_tiers": [],
      "triggers": [
        "adapters/**",
        "games/_template/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "registry_pytest",
      "label": "pytest：私服 -Stop 误判回归（隔离于并行线之外）",
      "base_tiers": [],
      "triggers": [
        "toolchain/registry/**",
        "toolchain/tests/test_registry_stop_pidfile_rewrite_timestamp.py"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_pytest",
      "label": "pytest：文档相关子集（markdown 链接 + 编辑器文档一致性）",
      "base_tiers": [
        "T0"
      ],
      "trigger_md": true,
      "triggers": [
        "**/*.md",
        "architecture/**",
        "docs/**"
      ]
    },
